{"id":"n21130-1-7","stage":1,"title":"분홍색 · 粉红色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21130-1-7-1","ko":"유민이 딸의 돌잔치 선물로 뭐가 좋을까?","zh":"送裕敏女儿什么周岁礼物好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이","audio":"/audio/b0f813b33e356d859fe9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"딸의","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌잔치","meaning":"周岁宴","explanation":"돌잔치：周岁宴","readings":[{"term":"돌잔치","audio":"/audio/a3be8467e7bbd71a3dc3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48330","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌잔치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물로","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"2","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을까?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"a3be8467e7bbd71a","term":"돌잔치","zh":"周岁宴","audio":"/audio/a3be8467e7bbd71a3dc3.mp3","entryId":"48330","definition":"庆祝孩子第一个生日的宴会。","pronunciation":["돌잔치"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不确定的对象或无需指明名字的对象。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/65488ede1fc5cd900d9c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21130-1-7-2","ko":"딸이니까 분홍색 장난감은 어때?","zh":"是女孩，粉色玩具怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"딸이니까","meaning":"女儿","explanation":"딸：女儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"딸","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30210","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분홍색","meaning":"粉红色，粉红","explanation":"분홍색：粉红色，粉红","readings":[{"term":"분홍색","audio":"/audio/cdd43df3585ad93fdc57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21130","senseId":"1","lemma":"분홍색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"장난감은","meaning":"玩具","explanation":"장난감：玩具；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"장난감","audio":"/audio/1202a938fbf31f6b843d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71207","senseId":"1","lemma":"장난감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"cdd43df3585ad93f","term":"분홍색","zh":"粉红色，粉红","audio":"/audio/cdd43df3585ad93fdc57.mp3","entryId":"21130","definition":"白色与红色混合而成的颜色。","pronunciation":["분ː홍색"]},{"id":"1202a938fbf31f6b","term":"장난감","zh":"玩具","audio":"/audio/1202a938fbf31f6b843d.mp3"